; Stage 15 W4b sibling sweep (design/stage15-stress-test/diagnostics.md
; §W4b): before the fix, a bare colon-typed macro name ("m:i32") sailed past
; `emit-defmacro`'s `!= NODE-SYM` check unchanged and registered the macro
; under that literal, unlookupable key -- compiling with NO diagnostic at the
; definition; the call site then failed as an unrelated "unknown: m". Now
; rejected at the `defmacro` line.
(defmacro m:i32 (x) x)

(defn main ():i32 (m 1))
